evidence/grok-sol-004-007-report.json:4:  "summary": "SOL-004/005/006 candidate gates completed with two byte-identical clean offline check builds. SOL-007 structural multi-mod inventory gate passed; required client/server runtime launch evidence was not executed because no isolated controlled launch harness with successor JAR + Variant Loader + deadlock-fix was available without mutating production gate packs.",
