evidence/grok-sol-004-007-report.json:78:      "blocker": "No isolated controlled MC/Forge client or server launch harness was available that could install the successor companion + pinned Variant Loader + deadlock-fix without mutating existing production-gate packs under /root/iob-*. Existing gate packs ship an older companion jar and lack Variant Loader/deadlock-fix together. Per instructions, runtime evidence was not fabricated and gates were not weakened."
