evidence/sol-after-sol001.log:1662:- Stop cancelling dragon `getModelLocation` / `getAnimationFileLocation` (and do not pin dragon textures). Variant Loader 2.6.4/2.7.0 overwrites those lookups via `BaseDragonModelMixin`, per-species model mixins, and `ModelRedirectUtil`; a HEAD-cancellable stock `ResourceLocation` prevented variant geo/anim from applying and exploded remapped dragons.
