evidence/sol-final-fresh.log:459:The historical Vonix waves through `1.2.1-vonix.13` were audited. The companion intentionally implements only the narrow, defensible subset documented here. See [CANDIDATE-REPORT.md](CANDIDATE-REPORT.md) for the wave-by-wave disposition.
evidence/sol-final-fresh.log:463:The published 1.0.0 GitHub asset is the pre-cadence-conversion companion. The current dirty successor adds `AiMoveCadence` / `PerformanceSettings`, tick-HEAD AI decisions, and egg/shock snapshot hot paths; bind its identity from `CANDIDATE-REPORT.successor.md` and `evidence/candidate-manifest.json` after a successful local build — do not treat the historical 1.0.0 or 0.3.1-rc.1 JAR hashes as this successor.
