evidence/sol-current-focused.log:4172:evidence/sol-current-focused-prompt.txt:3:Known prior SOL findings: true tick cadence required; transformed behavior/lifecycle tests inadequate; repeated Forge config lookups in hot paths; stale CANDIDATE-REPORT; source manifest incomplete; no fresh Variant Loader/deadlock-fix coexistence test. Review exact current source, mixins, tests, Gradle files, metadata, and candidate report only. Check whether partial cadence changes compile and are integrated; verify all active mixin methods use reload-correct primitive snapshots; verify one decision per goal tick and return-value semantics; verify reset/lifecycle hooks; verify config reload behavior; inspect actual hot paths for allocations/config reads and bounded CPU changes; inspect manifests/provenance and artifact identity. Do not recommend workarounds, ARR base edits, gameplay/RNG/progression drift, silent failures, or unsupported performance claims. Preserve exact behavior except reviewed cadence/performance changes.
