evidence/sol-current-focused.log:4556:evidence/sol-deep-001/codex-stdout.log:9157:      "exact_repair": "Add an ASM-based target test that verifies control flow and return-value consumption, plus post-Mixin transformed-bytecode checks. Add an integration fixture covering zero, one, and multiple eligible calls per tick; start/stop/restart; disabled and interval-1 modes; config reload; and long-lived counter behavior. Verify the egg and shock constants by their IREM/packet/damage dataflow, not only literal counts. Pin and record the tested IoB dependency digest."
